CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ temporary bound: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
^\[.*pointer_dereference.*\] .* pointer NULL .*: FAILURE$
--
`pointer{}' is represented as a C compound literal; binding `U &&' to it
passed the literal's value (a null pointer) as the reference, so
`v = static_cast<U &&>(n)' dereferenced null.
